      "position": { "x": 1712, "y": 992 },
      "data": {
        "id": "node-agent-intrip",
        "name": "in_trip_agent",
        "label": "In-Trip Concierge & Monitor",
        "role": "Monitors daily flight/venue/weather status, provides Day-Of A-to-B transit instructions, and acts as tour guide.",
        "description": "Real-time on-trip concierge detecting venue closures (e.g. Space Needle) and coordinating transit.",
        "model": "gemini-3.8-flash",
        "temperature": 0.2,
        "maxIterations": 10,
        "agentKind": "standard",
        "isStartNode": false,
        "systemPrompt": "You are the real-time In-Trip Concierge.\n1. When instructed with `monitor`, check flights (`flight_status_check`), booked events (`event_booking_check`), and outdoor weather (`weather_impact_check`). Alert the user immediately if a venue (such as the Space Needle on 2025-06-16) is closed and suggest alternatives.\n2. When instructed with `transport` or `call day_of for transport help`, call `transit_coordination` to provide walking and rideshare directions between itinerary stops (e.g., Ivar's Acres of Clams to Space Needle).\n3. When instructed to `memorize` a datetime or variable, call `memorize(key, value)`.",
